{
  "id": "nocodb",
  "name": "NocoDB",
  "description": "Hosted spreadsheet-database with a REST API. A good fit for a customer who has no system at all.",
  "docsUrl": "https://docs.nocodb.com/0.109.7/developer-resources/rest-apis",
  "verified": null,
  "notes": [
    "NOT YET VERIFIED against a live instance — written from documentation. The PostgREST preset was too, and the live run corrected three assumptions, so treat this as a starting point and use the Test panel before trusting it.",
    "Filters merge into ONE `where` param joined by ~and, unlike PostgREST's independent params. This is the only preset exercising filterStyle mode `composed`.",
    "The total is in the response body at pageInfo.totalRows, not a header.",
    "baseUrl ends with the table id: .../api/v2/tables/{tableId}",
    "A filter value containing the ~and separator is rejected rather than escaped — the per-API escaping grammar is unconfirmed."
  ],
  "template": {
    "baseUrl": "https://app.nocodb.com/api/v2/tables/REPLACE_TABLE_ID",
    "timeoutMs": 10000,
    "auth": { "type": "apiKey", "apiKeyLocation": "header", "name": "xc-token" },
    "filterStyle": { "mode": "composed", "param": "where", "join": "~and" },
    "sortStyle": { "mode": "param", "param": "sort", "asc": "{{field}}", "desc": "-{{field}}" },
    "pagination": {
      "style": "offset",
      "params": { "limit": "limit", "offset": "offset" },
      "total": { "from": "body", "path": "pageInfo.totalRows" }
    },
    "healthCheck": "search",
    "operations": [
      {
        "key": "search",
        "kind": "query",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/records",
        "filters": [
          { "key": "search", "label": "Plate", "type": "text", "fragment": "(plate,like,%{{value}}%)" },
          { "key": "make", "label": "Make", "type": "text", "fragment": "(make,eq,{{value}})" }
        ],
        "result": {
          "itemsPath": "list",
          "keyField": "Id",
          "labelField": "plate",
          "fields": [
            { "name": "ownerName", "path": "owner_name", "label": "Owner" },
            { "name": "vin", "path": "vin" },
            { "name": "make", "path": "make" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "get",
        "kind": "single",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/records",
        "filters": [
          { "key": "search", "label": "Plate", "type": "text", "fragment": "(plate,eq,{{value}})" }
        ],
        "notFound": { "match": { "emptyArray": true }, "behavior": "null" },
        "result": {
          "itemsPath": "list",
          "keyField": "Id",
          "labelField": "plate",
          "fields": [{ "name": "ownerName", "path": "owner_name" }]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "create",
        "kind": "write",
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/records",
        "idempotent": false,
        "body": "{{data}}",
        "result": { "keyField": "Id", "labelField": "plate" }
      }
    ]
  }
}
